RepriseOS extensions

Balance, Crossfeed, DSP and the Night Shift scheduling and gamma code are from
RevolaOS extensions, revision 36d197b180e55a304ea0468de4330c0d07fe715f.
Night Shift derives from kayboll’s RepriseOS work. Playback Log derives from
the work of brilliant-alien and lgreitis in osos-lab. Its Settings artwork is
from osos-lab commit 10485fa. Sleep Timer, Fast Seek and Long Audio Fix are
from RevolaOS extensions, revision c179e6dc21ea8a32e46bf9af1d0906c8793190e8.
Sleep Timer is based on kayboll’s RepriseOS Sleep Timer shortcut; Fast Seek
and Long Audio Fix are the same fixes as kayboll’s RepriseOS pull requests
63 and 62. Their catalog icons and the Sleep Timer moon are Cupertino Icons
glyphs (MIT), see the LICENSE.cupertino-icons beside each. Chapter Menu and
Chapter Marks are from RevolaOS extensions, revision
72562b52fe7e4074a3479caac86b84ec1d285966; their catalog icons are Cupertino
Icons glyphs (MIT) as well. The original RevolaOS notice follows.

